{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tammy and Matthew are successful restaurateurs. Their dreams have come true, but a new vacation and a new adventure are ahead. The heroes will not sit idly by and go on a new journey around the world to achieve a new goal - to master the art of confectioners and learn how to cook the best cupcakes in the world. They will have to visit all the famous confectioneries of the world and overcome many obstacles on the way and, of course, they are counting on your company and help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a lot of emotions as you travel to different corners of the world! Learn all the pastry secrets and enjoy this adventure to the fullest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Functional controls and clear tutorial will help you easily understand the basics of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;&quot;Travel Cuisine 2&quot;&quot; - a cozy adventure to different restaurants in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best sweets - Cakes, baklava, chocolate bars, marmalade and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tammy and Matthew are a pair of young restaurateurs who will always be with you on your adventures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful plot, colorful comics and characters, each with their own mood!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fascinating gameplay, the chance to feel like a master in the kitchen of an elite confectionery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many cheerful and very hungry customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 pastry shops to work in - a bakery, a sweet kingdom and a Turkish pastry shop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 hours of addictive gameplay for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant theme-based music.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926610?t=1755515979","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926610?t=1755515979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926610/bd42609e9cb0a14d46e0851a870ac541c352c4b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755515979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926610/bd42609e9cb0a14d46e0851a870ac541c352c4b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755515979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tammy and Matthew are successful restaurateurs. Their dreams have come true, but a new vacation and a new adventure are ahead. The heroes will not sit idly by and go on a new journey around the world to achieve a new goal - to master the art of confectioners and learn how to cook the best cupcakes in the world. They will have to visit all the famous confectioneries of the world and overcome many obstacles on the way and, of course, they are counting on your company and help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a lot of emotions as you travel to different corners of the world! Learn all the pastry secrets and enjoy this adventure to the fullest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Functional controls and clear tutorial will help you easily understand the basics of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;&quot;Travel Cuisine 2&quot;&quot; - a cozy adventure to different restaurants in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best sweets - Cakes, baklava, chocolate bars, marmalade and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tammy and Matthew are a pair of young restaurateurs who will always be with you on your adventures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful plot, colorful comics and characters, each with their own mood!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fascinating gameplay, the chance to feel like a master in the kitchen of an elite confectionery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many cheerful and very hungry customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 pastry shops to work in - a bakery, a sweet kingdom and a Turkish pastry shop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 hours of addictive gameplay for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant theme-based music.</p></li></ul>","developers":["GameOn Production"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926610/46f03e9c3541107bc3fb17950f05bf983fb2b105/header.jpg?t=1755515979","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2926610/1208370722/491c190f909118ca8d78d877b3e4a9e6d454f68f/1753421273/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753854825","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2926610/1208370722/491c190f909118ca8d78d877b3e4a9e6d454f68f/1753421273/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753854825","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2926610/1208370722/491c190f909118ca8d78d877b3e4a9e6d454f68f/1753421273/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753854825","id":257173750,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173750/25ebb45643c182f15cb08c78b01ae5c16df5a5d8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753854825"}],"name":"Travel Cuisine 2: Sweet Life","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a 